<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Designed by Roland Arajs, 2014</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
